Subject: [PATCH 16/38] Overlay wndproc: hide cursor over the game, clicks
 refocus MAME's window

The DISABLED+TRANSPARENT overlay made every click a Windows error beep
(EX_TRANSPARENT does not pass hit-tests without EX_LAYERED, so clicks hit
a disabled window) and left the arrow cursor floating over the game. Real
wndproc now: WM_SETCURSOR -> SetCursor(null), mouse buttons ->
SetForegroundWindow(owner). WS_DISABLED and WS_EX_TRANSPARENT dropped;
WS_EX_NOACTIVATE still keeps keyboard focus and DirectInput foreground on
MAME's window.

