From 40c0fd8efb3997e126c3d4ab9fe1daff4fbcc919 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d-b-c-e <anthony.mason1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 01:21:50 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 22/38] zeus2: backport mamedev/mame#15723 - solid fills, depth
 clear, translucency

Open upstream PR by Jos van Mourik: guard fast-clear depth 0 (stuck black
overlay after races), untextured solid-color quads via texmode bits 10-11
(triple flag-girl sprites), clamp 1.8 fixed-point translucency factors
before rgb_t::scale8 (cars randomly scaled near-black). Maps directly onto
the rig-observed Exotica artifacts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QABHMhAzD8GxaNT8zBVLho
