The Esc options menu now pauses the machine while open (request from the
GL thread, acted on at screen_update on the emu thread, transitions only
so a manual pause is never fought). Margin extend: unwritten 16:9 margin
pixels - black holes where the game's 4:3-era culling never drew - are
clamp-extended from the nearest written hardware-boundary pixel (one tap,
same written-mask as crack fill; MIDV_GL_MARGINFILL=0 disables). Shaders
regenerated; exact mode re-verified 100.0000%.

